There is a knock on the door.
It is Nina, my neighbour.
She says: "Hello, Maya."
Nina asks: "How are you?"
I say: "I am well, thank you."
"Are you happy here in Copenhagen?" she asks.
"Yes, I am happy," I say.
Nina smiles.
She is very kind.
She says: "Welcome."
I am not alone in Copenhagen.
Nina is my friend and my neighbour.
It is a good feeling.
I feel welcome.
